'''Heaven's Fruit''' is a [[Fruit Treasures|Fruit Treasure]] found in [[Into the Future]]. It improves the effect of most [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel]] [[Special Abilities|abilities]].

==Effect==
At 100% on all Heaven's Fruit Treasures, the following [[Special Abilities|abilities]] are enhanced when used against [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel Enemies]]:
