==Trivia==
*The Heaven's Fruit originally only improved the Weaken effect's duration by 10% and the Knockback effect's distance by 20%. This was changed at an unknown date.
*The Heaven's Fruit, like other fruit treasures, is based on a real-life fruit, this being an apple.

